@host = http://localhost:5009
@keyboard = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@mouse = 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222
@monitor = 33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333
@customer = aaaaaaaa-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### [Ordering] Ordering'in kendi ürün/fiyat kopyası
GET {{host}}/products

### [Inventory] Stoklar + rezervasyonlar
GET {{host}}/inventory

### [Payment] Ödemeler
GET {{host}}/payments

### (a) MUTLU YOL — 1 klavye (750 TRY) → Confirmed
# @name happy
POST {{host}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": "{{customer}}", "items": [ { "productId": "{{keyboard}}", "quantity": 1 } ] }

###
@happyId = {{happy.response.body.$.id}}

### (a) ~1 sn sonra: "status": "Confirmed"
GET {{host}}/orders/{{happyId}}

### (b) COMPENSATION — 2 monitör (13.000 TRY > 10.000 limit) → PaymentFailed → stok iade → Rejected
# @name compensation
POST {{host}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": "{{customer}}", "items": [ { "productId": "{{monitor}}", "quantity": 2 } ] }

###
@compensationId = {{compensation.response.body.$.id}}

### (b) "status": "Rejected", "statusReason": "Limit aşıldı..."
GET {{host}}/orders/{{compensationId}}

### (b) Monitör stoğu tekrar 5, rezervasyon "Released"
GET {{host}}/inventory

### (c) STOK YOK — 50 klavye → StockReservationFailed → Rejected (ödeme hiç denenmez)
# @name outOfStock
POST {{host}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": "{{customer}}", "items": [ { "productId": "{{keyboard}}", "quantity": 50 } ] }

###
@outOfStockId = {{outOfStock.response.body.$.id}}

### (c) "status": "Rejected", "statusReason": "'Klavye' için yeterli stok yok."
GET {{host}}/orders/{{outOfStockId}}

### Tüm siparişler
GET {{host}}/orders

### Onaylı siparişi kargola → 204
POST {{host}}/orders/{{happyId}}/ship

### Kargolanmış siparişi iptal etmeyi dene → 409
POST {{host}}/orders/{{happyId}}/cancel

### Yeni sipariş (iptal senaryosu)
# @name toCancel
POST {{host}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": "{{customer}}", "items": [ { "productId": "{{mouse}}", "quantity": 2 } ] }

###
@toCancelId = {{toCancel.response.body.$.id}}

### Confirmed olduktan sonra iptal → 204 (OrderCancelled → stok iadesi + ödeme iadesi)
POST {{host}}/orders/{{toCancelId}}/cancel

### Ödeme "Refunded" olmalı
GET {{host}}/payments

### Bilinmeyen ürün → 400
POST {{host}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": "{{customer}}", "items": [ { "productId": "99999999-9999-9999-9999-999999999999", "quantity": 1 } ] }

### Olmayan sipariş → 404
GET {{host}}/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
